# Logs
logs
*.log
# Transaction audit trail (backend/logs/*-transactions.md) holds real names +
# amounts, so daily logs stay LOCAL-ONLY and are never committed. The folder
# skeleton (README + .gitkeep) is kept so a fresh clone boots cleanly.
!backend/logs/
!backend/logs/README.md
!backend/logs/.gitkeep
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

